y</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Williams</surname><given-names>TL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A review of telemedicine cost-effectiveness studies</article-title><source>Journal of Telemedicine and Telecare</source><year>2000</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>S38</fpage><lpage>40</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10793967</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1258/1357633001934096</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Whitten</surname><given-names>PS</given-names></name><name><surname>Mair</surname><given-names>FS</given-names></name><name><surname>Haycox</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>May</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Williams</surname><given-names>TL</given-names></name><name><surname>Hellmich</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Systematic review of cost effectiveness studies of telemedicine interventions</article-title><source>British Medical Journal</source><year>2002</year><volume>324</volume><fpage>1434</fpage><lpage>7</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12065269</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1136/bmj.324.7351.1434</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bergmo</surname><given-names>TS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>An economic analysis of teleradiology versus a visiting radiologist service</article-title><source>Journal of Telemedicine and Telecare</source><year>1996</year><volume>2</volume><fpage>136</fpage><lpage>42</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9375047</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1258/1357633961929952</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bergmo</surname><given-names>TS</given-names></name></person-group><article-ti